{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd21 CLOWNS VS HUMANS \u2013 CHAOTIC FUN! (DEMO VERSION)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, or hunt! In this <strong>fast-paced multiplayer madness</strong>, clowns chase humans, and humans fight to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 The Concept:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clowns have <strong>1 minute</strong> to catch humans with their hammer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a clown hits a player \u2013 they turn into a clown, and the game continues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last uncaught clown <strong>loses</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae What\u2019s available in the demo?</strong><br>\ud83d\uddfa <strong>1 unique map\u00a0</strong>\u2013 The perfect playground for chaos! <br>\ud83e\udd21 <strong>2 character types</strong> \u2013 Clowns vs. Humans!<br>\u2694 <strong>4 game modes:</strong><br>\u2003- <strong>Free-for-all</strong> \u2013 Last player standing wins!<br>\u2003- <strong>Team mode</strong> \u2013 Work together to outplay the enemy!<br>\u2003- <strong>Candy Hunt</strong> \u2013 Grab the most treats to win!<br>\u2003- <strong>Survivor</strong> \u2013 Who will be the last one alive?<br>\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Special abilities</strong> \u2013 Teleportation, traps, disguises, and more!<br>\ud83e\udd23 <strong>Maximum fun</strong> \u2013 Fast, crazy, and full of laughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f This is a demo version with only 1 level and limited content. The full release will be even wilder!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for madness? Join the chaos and see who survives!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513150?t=1757551994","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513150?t=1757551994","capsule_image":"https